        <Geometry x:Key="IconYT">F0 M23.5,6.2 A3,3 0 0 0 21.4,4.1 C19.5,3.5 12,3.5 12,3.5 S4.5,3.5 2.6,4.1 A3,3 0 0 0 0.5,6.2 C0,8.1 0,12 0,12 S0,15.9 0.5,17.8 A3,3 0 0 0 2.6,19.9 C4.5,20.5 12,20.5 12,20.5 S19.5,20.5 21.4,19.9 A3,3 0 0 0 23.5,17.8 C24,15.9 24,12 24,12 S24,8.1 23.5,6.2 Z M9.5,15.6 V8.4 L15.8,12 Z</Geometry>
